  "as_of": "2017-08-17",
  "sentences": [
   "The bill would increase trustee beneficiary non-disclosure tax under the No. 2 legislation, covering specified trust income arrangements where income returns to the original trustee.",
   "The rate would rise from 47 per cent to 47.5 per cent, combining the top marginal income tax rate with the proposed higher Medicare levy.",
   "It would accompany the proposed Medicare levy increase in a wider package intended to help fund the Commonwealth's contribution to the National Disability Insurance Scheme."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "The increased rate would apply for the 2019-20 income year and later income years.",
   "Commencement would be linked to the companion Medicare levy legislation.",
   "Section 4 of the No. 2 tax imposition Act would contain the updated rate."
  ],
  "affected": "Trustees involved in the covered closely held trust income arrangements would be affected.",
